"┌ Help — tachy 0.1.0 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│ Normal · Navigation                                        Command palette                                           │"
"│ h ←              move the cursor left                      Enter        run                                          │"
"│ j ↓              move the cursor down                      Esc          close                                        │"
"│ k ↑              move the cursor up                        Tab          fill the arguments                           │"
"│ l →              move the cursor right                     ↓            select the next item                         │"
"│ ctrl-d           half a page down                          ↑            select the previous item                     │"
"│ ctrl-u           half a page up                                                                                      │"
"│ PgDn             one page down                             Jobs drawer                                               │"
"│ PgUp             one page up                               Tab Esc      back to the table                            │"
"│ Home             go to the first row                       j ↓          select the next job                          │"
"│ G                go to the last row (so far, while a fi…   k ↑          select the previous job                      │"
"│ 0                go to the first column                    p            pause or resume the job                      │"
"│ $                go to the last column                     K            kill the job                                 │"
"│ w                next column (skips frozen)                d            dismiss the finished job                     │"
"│ b                previous column (skips frozen)            focus it with Tab; other keys work as in Normal           │"
"│ g                go to a row, N% or a column name                                                                    │"
"│                                                            Inspector                                                 │"
"│ Normal · Tabs & files                                      Tab          next panel                                   │"
"│ 1–9              switch to tab N                           Esc          back to the table                            │"
"│ ctrl-o           open a file in a new tab                  j ↓          next field                                   │"
"│ ctrl-w           close the current tab                     k ↑          previous field                               │"
"│ R                reload the file from disk                 Enter        show the full value                          │"
"│                                                            other keys work as in Normal                              │"
"│ Normal · Find                                              Inspector · value popup                                   │"
"│ /                search                                    PgDn         one page down                                │"
"│ n                next search match                         PgUp         one page up                                  │"
"│ N                previous search match                     Home         top                                          │"
"│ f                new filter                                G            bottom                                       │"
"│ F                refine the current filter                 Esc Enter    close                                        │"
"│ x                pop the current view                      j ↓          scroll down                                  │"
"│ Enter            filtered/sorted view: jump to the sour…   k ↑          scroll up                                    │"
"│                                                                                                                      │"
"│ Normal · Sort & columns                                    Detected format                                           │"
"│ s                sort by the current column, ascending     Enter        accept                                       │"
"│ S                sort by the current column, descending    Esc          revert to the sniffed format                 │"
"│ query:  == != < <= > >=  ~ regex  contains starts ends  "x"i case-insensitive  in [..]  is [not] null  && || !       │"
"│ and or not  `col name`  $1                                                                                           │"
"│ goto:  g 50%  = the middle of the file by bytes while indexing,  the middle row once indexed                         │"
"└─ k/j scroll  PgUp/PgDn page  Home/G top/bottom  ?/Esc close ──────────────────────────────────────────── 1–35 of 66 ─┘"
